From 3d31da6e1430cc179e349632cf8774fd6c10e45d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Clay Stan <claystan97@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:41:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Platform/Radxa: add Orion O6N support

Port the Orion O6N board files from Radxa edk2-platforms 40a0f372fe01 onto the current CIX firmware baseline. Adapt the board to current common package paths and PCD namespaces while retaining the O6N memory, power, GPIO, UFS, Type-C, ACPI, and SMBIOS configuration.

Test: ./build-scripts/cix-build radxa-o6n-firmware
Change-Id: I8b200a465d99f20cfa6878473a3951ca0f899f3a
